<title>USA: Biocryst says raises $20 mln in secondary.</title>
<headline>Biocryst says raises $20 mln in secondary.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioCryst Pharmaceuticals Inc said on Thursday it completed a public offering of 2.0 million shares of its common stock at $10.00 per share, for total gross proceeds of $20 million.</p>
<p>The offering was managed by Smith Barney Inc and Needham &amp; Co. The underwriters have an over-allotment option covering up to an additional 300,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The proceeds from the offering will be used for funding research, product development programs and general corporate purposes, BioCryst said.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1733</p>
